 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 1.74"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":20.96,"default_fair_val":20.96,"premium_pct":-58.8,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":10.4,"pe_forward":9.2,"pb_trailing":1.1,"pb_forward":1,"div_yield":0,"ps_ratio":2.5,"fcf_to_ev":11.81,"fcf_to_mcap":9.94,"liab_to_assets":30.7,"cash_to_assets":26.2,"current_ratio":1.74,"roe":10.7,"roa":7.2,"moat":{"ticker":"TME","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"騰訊音樂擁有強大的品牌聲譽，尤其在中國年輕用戶群體中，這使其在音樂版權授權和付費訂閱服務方面具備一定的定價能力。然而，面對激烈的市場競爭和用戶對免費內容的偏好，其定價權並非絕對。品牌價值主要體現在其平台內容的吸引力，而非獨立的品牌溢價能力。","comment_en":"Tencent Music benefits from strong brand recognition, particularly among younger Chinese users, granting it some pricing power in music licensing and premium subscriptions. However, intense market competition and a user preference for free content limit its absolute pricing power. Brand value is primarily derived from platform content appeal rather than standalone brand premium."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"騰訊音樂的護城河主要來自於其龐大且獨家的音樂版權庫，這構成了一種內容特許經營權。監管環境對音樂版權的保護和市場集中度有影響，但同時也面臨反壟斷審查的風險。專利方面，公司在技術應用上有所投入，但核心壁壘仍在於版權內容的獲取與管理。","comment_en":"Tencent Music's moat stems significantly from its vast and exclusive music copyright library, acting as a form of content licensing. The regulatory environment impacts copyright protection and market concentration, though it also faces antitrust scrutiny. While the company invests in technological applications, its core barrier remains the acquisition and management of copyrighted content."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"用戶在騰訊音樂平台上的轉換成本相對較高，因為用戶習慣於其音樂庫、播放列表、社交互動功能以及已建立的個人化推薦系統。一旦用戶投入時間和精力建立起個人化的音樂體驗，轉移到其他平台將會失去這些累積的內容和社交連結，增加了轉換的阻力。","comment_en":"Switching costs for users on Tencent Music's platform are relatively high due to established music libraries, personalized playlists, social features, and recommendation algorithms. Users invest time and effort in building their music experience and social connections, making migration to other platforms inconvenient and leading to a loss of accumulated content and social ties."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"騰訊音樂平台展現了顯著的網絡效應。用戶越多，平台對音樂人、內容創作者的吸引力越大，進而帶來更多優質內容；同時，更多的內容和活躍用戶又反過來增強了平台的社交屬性和用戶黏性，形成正向循環。這種效應在社交聽歌和粉絲互動方面尤為突出。","comment_en":"Tencent Music exhibits strong network effects. A larger user base attracts more musicians and content creators, leading to richer content. Conversely, more content and active users enhance the platform's social features and user engagement, creating a virtuous cycle. This is particularly evident in social listening and fan interaction features."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"作為中國最大的在線音樂平台，騰訊音樂在版權採購、技術研發和市場推廣方面享有顯著的規模經濟效益。龐大的用戶基礎使其能夠攤薄高昂的版權成本，並在與內容提供商談判時獲得更有利的條件。這種規模優勢是新進入者難以複製的。","comment_en":"As China's largest online music platform, Tencent Music enjoys significant economies of scale in copyright acquisition, R&D, and marketing. Its massive user base allows it to amortize high copyright costs and negotiate more favorable terms with content providers. This scale advantage is difficult for new entrants to replicate."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"騰訊音樂的核心資產是其在中國市場的領導地位和龐大的用戶群體，這是一個獨特的地理和市場定位。其與騰訊集團的緊密聯繫也提供了額外的協同效應和資源支持。然而，其業務高度集中於中國市場，面臨單一市場的風險。","comment_en":"Tencent Music's core asset is its leading position and vast user base within the Chinese market, representing a unique geographical and market focus. Its close ties with Tencent Group provide additional synergistic benefits and resource support. However, its business is highly concentrated in China, posing single-market risks."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"騰訊音樂在運營效率方面表現出色，體現在其能夠有效管理龐大的版權庫、優化內容推薦算法、以及通過多元化收入模式（如在線音樂、數字專輯、直播打賞等）實現盈利。其持續的盈利能力和自由現金流生成能力證明了其高效的運營管理。","comment_en":"Tencent Music demonstrates strong operational efficiency, evident in its effective management of a vast copyright library, optimized content recommendation algorithms, and profitability through diversified revenue streams (online music, digital albums, live streaming rewards). Its consistent profitability and free cash flow generation underscore its efficient operational management."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"騰訊音樂展現了相對穩健的資本配置策略，通過持續的版權投資、技術研發投入以及戰略性收購來鞏固其市場地位。公司能夠產生健康的自由現金流，並在回購股票和潛在的戰略投資之間取得平衡，顯示出管理層對價值的關注。","comment_en":"Tencent Music exhibits a relatively sound capital allocation strategy, investing in copyright, R&D, and strategic acquisitions to solidify its market position. The company generates healthy free cash flow and balances share repurchases with potential strategic investments, indicating management's focus on value creation."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"通過豐富的內容庫、個性化推薦、社交互動功能以及會員體系，騰訊音樂成功地維持了高客戶留存率。用戶在平台上建立的個人化音樂檔案和社交關係，以及持續更新的內容，都極大地增強了用戶的忠誠度和黏性，降低了用戶流失的可能性。","comment_en":"Tencent Music achieves high customer retention through its rich content library, personalized recommendations, social features, and membership programs. Users build personalized music profiles and social connections on the platform, coupled with continuously updated content, significantly enhancing loyalty and stickiness, thereby reducing churn."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"騰訊音樂的商業模式具有一定的持久性，尤其是在中國音樂市場的領導地位和龐大的用戶基礎。然而，數字音樂行業的快速變化、新技術的出現（如 AI 生成音樂）以及潛在的監管風險，對其長期持久性構成挑戰。其核心競爭力在於持續獲取和管理版權的能力。","comment_en":"Tencent Music's business model possesses a degree of durability, primarily due to its leadership in the Chinese music market and its substantial user base. However, the rapidly evolving digital music industry, emergence of new technologies (like AI-generated music), and potential regulatory risks pose challenges to its long-term sustainability. Its core strength lies in its continuous ability to acquire and manage copyrights."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"騰訊音樂（TME）的護城河主要體現為一種基於龐大獨家音樂版權庫的「內容特許經營權」，並輔以顯著的網絡效應和用戶轉換成本。其規模經濟效益使其在成本控制和市場影響力上佔據優勢。然而，其業務高度依賴中國市場，且面臨數字音樂行業快速變革及監管不確定性。儘管品牌和用戶黏性強，但定價權並非絕對。整體而言，TME 擁有堅固的護城河，但其持久性取決於持續的版權獲取能力和對行業變革的適應性。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Tencent Music (TME) possesses a moat primarily characterized as a 'content franchise' built upon its vast exclusive music copyright library, significantly bolstered by network effects and user switching costs. Its economies of scale provide advantages in cost control and market influence. However, its business is heavily concentrated in China and faces challenges from the rapidly evolving digital music industry and regulatory uncertainties. While brand and user stickiness are strong, pricing power is not absolute. Overall, TME has a solid moat, but its durability hinges on its continued ability to secure copyrights and adapt to industry transformations.","evidenceHash":"d44a580ce7eb2630f5fc0a0b4a814ea5ca61a7803493f999dda0dfc3cca034c1","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":8,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"distress","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"CNY","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"9387fa591dddf396cdd5fb7d771a0bd866fa0811edfb1560be1d85613c45e91f"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"CNY","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"9387fa591dddf396cdd5fb7d771a0bd866fa0811edfb1560be1d85613c45e91f"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/TME.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/TME.png","website":"https://www.tencentmusic.com","ceo":"Zhu Liang","full_time_employees":"5690","description":"Tencent Music Entertainment Group (TME) is a premier operator of online music entertainment platforms across the People's Republic of China, offering a range of services including music streaming, digital karaoke, and live interactive broadcasting. Its offerings encompass popular streaming platforms like QQ Music, Kugou Music, and Kuwo Music, which facilitate personalized music discovery and listening for users. The company also developed WeSing, an engaging application that allows users to sing, socialize with friends, share their performances, and explore songs sung by others. Furthermore, TME runs interactive live broadcasting platforms, notably Kugou Live and Kuwo Live, providing an online venue for performers to exhibit their talents and interact with their audience. Kuwo Changting acts as a specialized audio content platform, featuring diverse spoken word entertainment such as audiobooks, traditional cross-talk, and radio dramas. Beyond its digital services, TME sells music-related hardware, including Kugou headsets, smart speakers, WeSing karaoke microphones, and Hi-Fi audio systems. It also handles online ticketing for music events and partners with manufacturers of smart devices and automobiles to embed and manage music services within their products and vehicles. Tencent Music Entertainment Group maintains a strategic partnership with China Literature. Headquartered in Shenzhen, China, the company functions as a subsidiary of Tencent Holdings Limited.","description_en":"Tencent Music Entertainment Group (TME) is a premier operator of online music entertainment platforms across the People's Republic of China, offering a range of services including music streaming, digital karaoke, and live interactive broadcasting. Its offerings encompass popular streaming platforms like QQ Music, Kugou Music, and Kuwo Music, which facilitate personalized music discovery and listening for users. The company also developed WeSing, an engaging application that allows users to sing, socialize with friends, share their performances, and explore songs sung by others. Furthermore, TME runs interactive live broadcasting platforms, notably Kugou Live and Kuwo Live, providing an online venue for performers to exhibit their talents and interact with their audience. Kuwo Changting acts as a specialized audio content platform, featuring diverse spoken word entertainment such as audiobooks, traditional cross-talk, and radio dramas. Beyond its digital services, TME sells music-related hardware, including Kugou headsets, smart speakers, WeSing karaoke microphones, and Hi-Fi audio systems. It also handles online ticketing for music events and partners with manufacturers of smart devices and automobiles to embed and manage music services within their products and vehicles. Tencent Music Entertainment Group maintains a strategic partnership with China Literature. Headquartered in Shenzhen, China, the company functions as a subsidiary of Tencent Holdings Limited.","description_zh":"**騰訊音樂娛樂集團 (TME) 業務營運精煉**\n\n騰訊音樂娛樂集團 (TME) 為中國領先的線上音樂娛樂平台營運商，提供多元化的服務，涵蓋音樂串流、數位卡拉OK及直播互動。其核心產品包括「QQ音樂」、「酷狗音樂」及「酷我音樂」等知名串流平台，致力於提供個人化的音樂探索與聆聽體驗。\n\nTME 亦開發了「全民K歌」應用程式，讓用戶能盡情歌唱、社交互動、分享表演並欣賞他人作品。此外，集團營運「酷狗直播」及「酷我直播」等互動直播平台，為表演者提供展現才華與與觀眾互動的線上空間。\n\n「酷我暢聽」則專注於多元化的語音內容，包含有聲書、傳統相聲及廣播劇等。除了數位服務，TME 也銷售音樂相關硬體，如酷狗耳機、智慧音箱、全民K歌麥克風及高傳真音響系統。\n\n集團同時負責音樂活動的線上票務，並與智慧裝置及汽車製造商合作，將音樂服務嵌入其產品與載具。TME 與中國閱文集團維持策略合作關係，總部位於深圳，為騰訊控股有限公司的子公司。","address":"Building D","city":"Shenzhen","state":"GD","zip":"518057","country":"CN","phone":"86 75 5860 13388","full_address":"Building D, Shenzhen, GD 518057, CN","range_52w":"7.66-23.86","year_high":23.86,"year_low":7.66,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":7.66,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-10-19","name":"MAK YAU KEE ADRIAN","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":9271,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-19","name"